TEST-ONLY KEY — DO NOT REUSE.

example.key is an unencrypted minisign secret key that is committed to this
public repository on purpose, so the spec validator, the worker's tests and the
end-to-end test can sign and verify the hello-project fixture.

It protects nothing. Never put its public half into a real project's
agentfund.yaml. Generate your own key with `agentfund keygen`.

Re-sign the fixture after editing a manifest:

    agentfund sign examples/hello-project/tasks --key examples/hello-project/.example-key/example.key
